Route26_Text_Fisher_1::
	.string "This is a great fishing spot!\p"
	.string "What? Why do you bother me?\p"
	.string "Oh, I see... You want a battle...\p"
	.string "But, you know. I may be a bit too\n"
	.string "much for you, son.\p"
	.string "Do you still want to fight?$"

Route26_Text_Fisher_2::
	.string "Oh, that’s right.\p"
	.string "Well, I’ll hang around here, in\n"
	.string "case you need me!$"

Route26_Text_Fisher_3::
	.string "That is a PP MAX!\p"
	.string "It will boost the PPs of the chosen\n"
	.string "move to its maximum.\p"
	.string "So, you better be careful what move\n"
	.string "you choose, son!$"

Route26_Text_Fisher_4::
	.string "You sure?\n"
	.string "OK, then.\p"
	.string "But don’t say I didn’t warn you!$"

Route26_Text_FisherDefeat::
	.string "Oh, you are stronger than I thought.$"

Route26_Text_FisherVictory::
	.string "Next time, son.$"

Route26_Text_Fisher_5::
	.string "I’m happy to see your strength, well\n"
	.string "I guess I don’t need this anymore\l"
	.string "so I’ll give it to you!$"

Route26_Text_FishermanScottIntro::
	.string "I’m feeling great today!\p"
	.string "I feel like I could boot even\n"
	.string "the LEAGUE CHAMP!$"

Route26_Text_FishermanScottDefeat::
	.string "No! Not in this battle!$"

Route26_Text_FishermanScott::
	.string "Just like in fishing, it’s all over\n"
	.string "in POKéMON if you give up.$"

Route26_Text_PsychicRichardIntro::
	.string "Wow, look at all those BADGES!\n"
	.string "I’m impressed.\p"
	.string "But you’re not satisfied by just\n"
	.string "collecting them, right?$"

Route26_Text_PsychicRichardDefeat::
	.string "Good battle!$"

Route26_Text_PsychicRichard::
	.string "People and POKéMON grow from their\n"
	.string "experiences.\p"
	.string "Don’t get lazy and complacent.$"

Route26_Text_CooltrainerJoyceIntro::
	.string "Since you’ve come this far, you must\n"
	.string "be good.\p"
	.string "I’m going to give this battle\n"
	.string "everything I’ve got!$"

Route26_Text_CooltrainerJoyceDefeat::
	.string "No! I don’t believe this!$"

Route26_Text_CooltrainerJoyce::
	.string "I’ve defeated eight GYM LEADERS,\n"
	.string "so I was feeling confident.\p"
	.string "I’ll have to try harder next time.$"

Route26_Text_Cooltrainer302Intro::
	.string "By experiencing tough battles, you\n"
	.string "gain power.$"

Route26_Text_Cooltrainer302Defeat::
	.string "Gaah! Life is even tougher!$"

Route26_Text_Cooltrainer302::
	.string "To get to POKéMON LEAGUE, you have\n"
	.string "to get through VICTORY ROAD.\p"
	.string "But VICTORY ROAD is tough.\n"
	.string "Practically nobody goes there!$"

Route26_Text_CooltrainerJakeIntro::
	.string "I’m making my final preparations\n"
	.string "for the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"

Route26_Text_CooltrainerJakeDefeat::
	.string "I blew it!$"

Route26_Text_CooltrainerJake::
	.string "It’s going to be tough to win at\n"
	.string "the LEAGUE.\p"
	.string "I need to do some more training.\p"
	.string "I hear that the LEAGUE’s ELITE\n"
	.string "FOUR are tougher than GYM LEADERS.$"

Route26_Text_Cooltrainer518Intro::
	.string "I lost to a trainer named {RIVAL}.\p"
	.string "He was really strong, but...\p"
	.string "It was as if he absolutely had to\n"
	.string "win at any cost.\p"
	.string "I felt sorry for his POKéMON.$"

Route26_Text_Cooltrainer518Defeat::
	.string "POKéMON aren’t tools of war.$"

Route26_Text_Cooltrainer518::
	.string "POKéMON are invaluable, lifelong\n"
	.string "partners.$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "HELP!\n"
	.string "Somebody help me!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "Hey you!\n"
	.string "Will you help me?\p"
	.string "This PIKACHU wants to attack me!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "Hehe... I never thought you would\n"
	.string "fall for that!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "Now... GO PIKACHU!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "{PLAYER} loses the BADGES!!!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "HAHAHA!\p"
	.string "Now we’ll be able to get into the\n"
	.string "LEAGUE quite easily!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "Now, now... Don’t look at me like\n"
	.string "that, kid!\p"
	.string "Sometimes you win...\n"
	.string "Sometimes you lose!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "What?\n"
	.string "You’ll fight to recover your BADGES?\p"
	.string "Hey! I like the idea!\p"
	.string "Now I’ll also have the opportunity to\n"
	.string "steal your POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Let’s play then, kid!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "Ouch! It cannot be!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "Mwahaha!\n"
	.string "Such a weak trainer...$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "I don’t understand...\n"
	.string "Why?\p"
	.string "Why a great thief like me, ASHLEE\n"
	.string "would be defeated by this brat?$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "ASHLEE: But...\n"
	.string "We won’t give you anything back!\p"
	.string "Mwahaha!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_11::
	.string "PIKACHU drops {PLAYER}’s BADGES.$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_12::
	.string "ASHLEE: Oh No!\p"
	.string "Oh well... We’ll have better luck\n"
	.string "next time, PIKACHU!$"

Route26_Text_Trigger1_13::
	.string "{PLAYER} recovered the BADGES!$"

Route26_Text_Sign1::
	.string "ROUTE 26\n"
	.string "POKéMON LEAGUE RECEPTION GATE$"
